WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
OD Amnesia activates against Ryu’s recorded strike.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.400
The back throw scores punish counter and changes sides.

3
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.400
Forward heavy kick catches Ryu after the automatic Amnesia blasts.

4
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.900
Heavy Stribog extends after the performed delay.

5
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:06.400
A forward dash brings standing heavy punch into the juggle.

6
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:07.100
